{"agent_id":"s004-wave","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-08-20T22:59:13.451175121Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"433d299e-564b-4493-9c25-83782587c66e","title":"Make sandboxed worktree tests support linked checkout git metadata","description":"Running the locked all-feature/all-target suite from a linked worktree deterministically fails six src/tools/worktree.rs unit tests. ToolRunContext::test_run_context roots the GitWorktree sandbox at env!(CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR), while a linked worktree .git file points to the common gitdir outside that capability. Sandboxed git therefore reports not inside a repository although host git rev-parse succeeds. Observed from /home/doll/OpenClaudia/.worktrees/s004-startup-migrations at baseline 9194ac26 during S-004 verification: 2637 library tests passed, 6 failed, 1 ignored. Fix should preserve sandbox authority and add linked-worktree runtime coverage; do not broaden the sandbox to arbitrary host paths.","priority":"medium","created_by":"s004-wave"},"signed_by":"SHA256:aYyc+2g0o8C/BrTc8XRSOz9rn0QmRPd7Yf3dQfWyvZ4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg91tlCd5BDW96nHQ90mDKp3ek6NoO80GC7KGanAji4wIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEadtPMC82mN5c5ctqejh/ZUXGgWlGORApHBVp2s4p0IN48j372kXdBTBJutZP7ij25fT8ia84mqUlePzO73UgE="}
